## Section 8: Shift Exchange Workflow

Supports shift swapping requests between doctors.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant DocA as Doctor A (Requestor)
    participant DocB as Doctor B (Reciprocator)
    participant Sys as DMS Engine
    participant Head as Dept Head
    
    DocA->>Sys: Propose Shift Swap with Doc B
    Sys->>Sys: Run Conflict & Coverage Check
    Sys->>DocB: Swap Invitation Notification
    DocB->>Sys: Accept Swap Invitation
    Sys->>Head: Notify Head of Swap Proposal
    Head->>Sys: Approve Swap Request
    Sys->>Sys: Re-assign Roster Slots
    Sys->>DocA: Swap Completed Alerts
    Sys->>DocB: Swap Completed Alerts
```

* **Swap Constraints Checker:** Automatically rejects requests if the proposed swap violates shift rest guidelines or results in overlapping schedules.

